        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Pomeranian, Sporting Lucas Terrier, Japanese Spitz\n- Concepts: dog breeds, Spitz type, terrier type, breed standards, Pomerania\n\nFacts:\n- The Pomeranian is a breed of dog of the Spitz type.\n- The Pomeranian is often known as a Pom or Pom Pom.\n- The Pomeranian is named for the Pomerania region in Germany and Poland in Central Europe.\n- The Sporting Lucas Terrier is a small breed of dog of the terrier type.\n- The Japanese Spitz has varying breed standards around the world for its ideal size.\n- The Japanese Spitz is always larger than the smaller Pomeranian.",
